WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.001
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:03.035
"This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.035 --> 00:00:04.037
We hope you're doing
well tonight.

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:05.104
And, now, let's get to the news.

00:00:05.104 --> 00:00:07.306
The Biden administration
today ordered

00:00:07.306 --> 00:00:10.009
U.S. companies
with 100 or more employees

00:00:10.009 --> 00:00:13.346
to have their workers fully
vaccinated or regularly tested

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:15.448
for the coronavirus
by January 4th.

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:17.317
Alright!
You heard the man,

00:00:17.317 --> 00:00:18.785
Arcade Fire.

00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:22.588
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.588 --> 00:00:23.790
And we're off!

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:25.291
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.291 --> 00:00:27.961
New Jersey Governor Phil Murphy
won reelection last night,

00:00:27.961 --> 00:00:30.763
making him the first Democrat
in 44 years

00:00:30.763 --> 00:00:32.765
to be sentenced
to a second term.

00:00:32.765 --> 00:00:35.635
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.635 --> 00:00:37.569
Despite telling reporters
earlier this year

00:00:37.569 --> 00:00:38.905
that he'd been immunized,

00:00:38.905 --> 00:00:40.339
Green Bay quarterback
Aaron Rodgers

00:00:40.339 --> 00:00:42.208
reportedly received
a homeopathic treatment

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:45.011
from his personal doctor
to raise his antibody levels,

00:00:45.011 --> 00:00:46.980
instead of getting
the coronavirus vaccine.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.148
Dude, that's an immunization

00:00:49.148 --> 00:00:51.251
the same way this
is a ponytail.

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:52.819
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.819 --> 00:00:55.754
It's not.

00:00:55.754 --> 00:00:58.123
According to a new report,
Dominion Voting Systems'

00:00:58.123 --> 00:01:00.360
$1.3 billion defamation lawsuit

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:02.762
against MyPillow CEO
Mike Lindell could result

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:05.097
in Dominion owning
the pillow company,

00:01:05.097 --> 00:01:06.666
but they're not interested

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:08.701
because the voting booths
are more comfortable.

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:10.703
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.703 --> 00:01:13.172
That's right, Dominion could
end up owning MyPillow.

00:01:13.172 --> 00:01:15.808
Wow. If that happens, I hope
they keep the Dominion name.

00:01:15.808 --> 00:01:18.912
Dominion would be a badass name
for a pillow company.

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:20.646
[ Laughter ]
Dominion Pillows.

00:01:20.646 --> 00:01:22.649
You will sleep, loser!

00:01:22.649 --> 00:01:24.450
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:26.218
A new study suggests men

00:01:26.218 --> 00:01:28.988
feel more heartbroken than women
after a breakup.

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:30.256
The study is entitled...

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:34.127
[ Laughter and ohs ]

00:01:35.562 --> 00:01:37.630
In honor of the
"Sex and the City" reboot,

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:39.965
Airbnb will offer guests
a chance to stay

00:01:39.965 --> 00:01:43.369
at a recreation of Carrie's
apartment for $23 per night.

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:44.904
Or, for just $10,

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:47.106
Steve will come over
and hang at your place.

00:01:47.106 --> 00:01:49.342
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.342 --> 00:01:51.210
[ As Steve ]
Hey, thanks so much
for having me over.

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:52.712
Miranda and I
are having a fight.

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:54.347
It's so good.
It's such a good Steve.

00:01:54.347 --> 00:01:57.550
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.550 --> 00:02:00.253
Finally, today was rapper
and entrepreneur

00:02:00.253 --> 00:02:02.454
Sean P. "Diddy" Combs'
52nd birthday.

00:02:02.454 --> 00:02:04.457
He celebrated the same way
he always does --

00:02:04.457 --> 00:02:06.592
in line at the notary
public's office,

00:02:06.592 --> 00:02:08.460
getting his name
legally changed.

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:11.064
[ Laughter ]
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

